From a72276407ba4a438d4e34edd0d5ebf48cd6d9b63 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Linus Groh <mail@linusgroh.de>
Date: Wed, 24 Feb 2021 09:48:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] LibJS: Make ArrayPrototype an Array object

https://tc39.es/ecma262/#sec-properties-of-the-array-prototype-object

The Array prototype object: [...] is an Array exotic object and has the
internal methods specified for such objects.

NOTE: The Array prototype object is specified to be an Array exotic
object to ensure compatibility with ECMAScript code that was created
prior to the ECMAScript 2015 specification.
---
 Userland/Libraries/LibJS/Runtime/Array.cpp                  | 5 +++++
 Userland/Libraries/LibJS/Runtime/Array.h                    | 3 ++-
 Userland/Libraries/LibJS/Runtime/ArrayPrototype.cpp         | 5 ++---
